    "derivation": "Core constraint parameters are sh:path values of sh:Parameter nodes on sh:ConstraintComponent instances whose rdfs:label does not identify a SPARQL, JavaScript, or expression component. Core targets are rdf:Property values with rdfs:domain sh:Shape whose local name starts with 'target'. sh:path is included when the vocabulary gives it rdfs:domain sh:PropertyShape. SHACL-SPARQL evidence predicates are sh:sparql plus properties whose rdfs:domain is a SPARQL ASK, SELECT, CONSTRUCT, or UPDATE executable. sh:sparql, sh:select, and sh:ask are not SHACL Core constraints."
